## Error Prevention

### Common Mistakes to Avoid
1. **Missing required fields**: Ensure all mandatory fields are present
2. **Invalid slug format**: Use only lowercase letters, numbers, and hyphens
3. **Incorrect data types**: ABV as string with %, IBU/SRM as strings without units
4. **Broken image paths**: Verify images exist at specified locations
5. **Duplicate slugs**: Ensure unique slugs across all beer entries
6. **Invalid status values**: Use only defined status options
7. **HTML in frontmatter**: Keep YAML clean, HTML only in content body

### Validation Checklist
- [ ] All required fields present
- [ ] Valid slug format (lowercase, hyphens only)
- [ ] Image file exists at specified path
- [ ] ABV includes % symbol
- [ ] IBU/SRM are strings without units
- [ ] Status value is valid
- [ ] Slug is unique across all beers
- [ ] Brief description under 200 characters
- [ ] Markdown content is valid
- [ ] No HTML in frontmatter

